<!-- Template Description -->
Returns the maximum of up to three numeric values. Ignores invalid or empty inputs and automatically adjusts based on how many valid values are provided.

==Syntax==
{{T|Max|v1=|v2=|v3=}}

==Examples==
{{T|Max|v1=5|v2=8|v3=2}} → 8<br/>
{{T|Max|v1=7|v2=abc|v3=3}} → 7<br/>
{{T|Max|v1=|v2=4|v3=}} → 4<br/>
{{T|Max|v1=hello|v2=|v3=}} → (no output)<br/>

